# ⚠️ DEPRECATED: ID-based trip routes are deprecated
# 
# DO NOT create page.tsx or [tripId]/page.tsx in this directory.
# 
# All trip routes should use slug-based URLs:
#   CORRECT: /[userSlug]/[tripSlug]/page.tsx
#   WRONG:   /trip/[tripId]/page.tsx (DEPRECATED)
# 
# The /trip/new route is the ONLY exception and should remain.
# 
# See: docs/specifications/slug-generation-specification.md
